            "review_title": "Review at The Soulcatcher - Hidden Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "GrandTour11246624402\nHa Long City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nA perfect place\nMay 2024 • Couples\nA hidden gem need to be known more. Perfect cocktail that is absolutely stand out with others cocktail bar in Halong. There’s no fixed menu, you will create your own drink with order, it’s a good choice cause you can try different cocktail in different moods or weather. The bartender is humorous and talkative. The atmosphere here is cozy and friendly, you can catch up or take shots with others customer around the bar… Satisfied everytime I come here!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nShould book for a reservation, suitable for small groups, couples or even alone. If you don’t like jazz or deeptalk you shouldn’t come here\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 12, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-12",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
