            "review_title": "Review at The Soulcatcher - Hidden Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Nhung N\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nHidden gem in the city by night\nSep 2023 • Couples\nThis bar is like a secret hideout in the city. It's cozy and dimly lit, perfect for relaxing and enjoying some unique cocktails away from the crowds. The bartender totally knew what he's doing and could give anyone a good deep conversation if needed.\nInsider tip:\nif you want something strange but interesting in taste, just simply describe what in your mind so that the bartender could shake and make\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 9, 2024",
