            "review_title": "Review at The Soulcatcher - Hidden Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Amy\n1 contribution\n0\nRealy a hidden gem 🫶🏻\nApr 2024 • Friends\nThis is a really hidden gem in Halong! \nThe atmoshere is super chill and relaxing. I went with my friend, ordered directly from the bartender. The drinks were super stunning! Even I could order a cocktail based on my mood on the day, and the bartender delivered just perfectly! Bonus point is the head bartender is really attentive and handsome kkk. Oh, and they had a good taste of Jazz playlists too! Highly recommend!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 5, 2024",
