            "review_text": "Escape32261516810\n1 contribution\n0\nThe Bar you should go to to Chill\nApr 2024 • Friends\nMy close friends and I will spend a few days a month to come here off team and enjoy fun moments together. The restaurant's space creates a very warm and cozy feeling, and the drinks cannot be faulted. The special thing is that the shop is on the top floor of the house, very hidden but the space is also very open. A very Hanoi feeling. Professional bartender and enthusiastic, lovely staff. In addition, the ground floor is a cute little cafe, also one of my familiar places to stay.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 2, 2024",
